# Content & Navigation

## Language
- User-facing text is Persian
- Tone: fresh and plain, like a neighborhood grocery. Not luxury editorial, not a multi-seller بازارچه
- Say میوه، سبزی، سبد، سفارش، آدرس. Do not say فروشنده or بازارچه

## Navigation
- Customer tabs are the five links in `bottom-nav.tsx`: `/`, `/categories`, `/cart`, `/orders`, `/account`
- Addresses are reached from حساب, not from the tab bar
- Do not link to a route that has no `page.tsx`

## Shipping copy
- Above 300,000 toman: «ارسال رایگان برای این سفارش» and shipping label «رایگان»
- Otherwise: «طبق قوانین», plus «تا ارسال رایگان» only when some amount is still remaining
- Read the threshold from `FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD` in `src/config/brand.ts`. Do not hardcode a second number

## Status labels
- Use `orderStatusLabel` in `src/data/order-status.ts`. Do not invent a second Persian label for the same status
